<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1 Petera</book>
  <para style="h">1 Petera</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Petera</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petera</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Petera</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Petera, Isua Krista tirhkoh chuan, Pathian mi thlan, Ponto ram te, Galatia ram te, Kapadokia ram te, Asia ram te leh Bithunia rama awm darh tate chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pa Pathian hriat lâwk anga thlan, Isua Krista thu awih tûr leh a thisena tlen fai tûra Thlarau Tihthianghlim in in ni a, in chungah khawngaihna leh remna tihpunin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista Pathian leh Pa chu fakin awm rawh se. Isua Krista chu mitthi zîng ata kai thovin, beiseina nung nei tûrin a zahngaihna ropui tak chuan min tinung leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ro chhe thei lo, hmêlhem lo leh chuai thei lo luah tûr kan ni ta, chu ro chu in tân vânah dah ṭhat diam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah in rin avângin chhandamna buatsaih sa, hun hnuhnûnga tihlan a nih thlengin Pathian thiltihtheihna chuan a vawng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fiahna tinrêng in tawha, in mangan pawhin hlim takin awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In rinna fiahna tûr a ni, rangkachak chhe thei mah meia fiah a ni a, a aia hlu zâwk, in rinna chu, fiah tûr a ni asin; tichuan, Isua Krista a lo inlâr hunah fakna te, ropuina te, chawimawina te in hlawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah hmu lo pawhin in hmangaih a, tûnah hian ani chu hmu rih lo mah ula in ring a, hlimna nasa tak, sawi hleih theih lohvin in khah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />in rinna rah, in thlarau chhandamna chu, in hmuh mêk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He chhandamna chungchâng hi zâwlneiten ngun taka zawngin an chhui a, in chunga Pathian thilpêk, khawngaihna lo thleng tûr chu an lo sawi lâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anmahnia Krista thlarau awm chuan, Krista tuarna leh a hnua chawimawia a awm tûr thu a hriat lâwktîr a, eng hunah nge a lo thlen anga, engtia lo thleng tûr nge tih hriat an tum ṭhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anmahni tân ni lo, nangmahni tân rawng an bâwl a ni tih hriattîr an ni a. Vân aṭanga tirh, Thlarau Thianghlim ṭanpuia in hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hriltute khân chu chu an hrilh tâk che u kha. Chûng thil chu vântirhkohte pawhin bih an châk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, rilru inpeih diamin inring reng ula, Isua Krista a lo lan huna khawngaihna a rawn kensak tûr che u chu beisei tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fa thuawihte angin awm ula, tûn hma, in hriat loh laia in châknate ang khân awm suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kotu che u a thianghlim angin nangni pawh in chêt dân zawng zawngah lo thianghlim zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kei ka thianghlim si a, nangni pawh in thianghlim tûr a ni,” Lehkha Thu-in a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hleih nei lova mi tin an thiltih ang zêla ngaihtuahsaktu chu Pa-ah in neih chuan, he leia in châm chhûng hian amah ṭih takin khawsa rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In thlahtute aṭanga in dawn chhâwn, nun dân âtthlâk tak ata chu, thil chhe thei tangka leh rangkachaka tlan in ni lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Berâmno hmêlhem lo leh bawlhhlawh kai lo, Krista thisen hlua tlan in ni zâwk tih in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chu leilung pian hmaa ruat lâwk a ni a, tûn hun hnuhnûngah hian in tân a lo lang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mitthi zîng ata kaithotu leh ropuina petu Pathian chu amah avângin in ring ta a; tichuan, Pathian chu in rinna leh beiseina innghahna ber a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thutak in zawm avângin in rilru in tithianghlim a, unaute tihtakzetin in hmangaih ta a, thinlung takin inhmangaih tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chi chhe thei lakah ni lovin, chi chhe thei lo Pathian chatuan thu nung laka piangthar in nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Mi zawng zawng hnim hring ang an ni, an ropuinate pawh hnim pâr ang a ni; Hnim chu a vuai a, a pâr chu a tla a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa thu erawh chu chatuanin a awm reng,” tih a ni. Chu ngei chu a ni Chanchin Ṭha an hrilh che u kha.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, sual chi tinrêng bânsan rawh u, inbum te, vervêk te, îtsîk te, insawichhiat zawng zawng te bânsan ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nausên piang hlim angin thlarau lam hnutetui eng mah pawlh loh chu châk rawh u, chutiang ring chuan in ṭhang lian thei ang a, chhandam in ni dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lalpa ṭhatna chu tem teh rêng u,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah chu pan rawh u. Ani chu lung nung, mihringte hnâwl, Pathian thlan, hlu tak chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, nangni pawh lung nung ang ni vein thlarau lam in atân rem khâwm ni ve rawh u. Chutah chuan Isua Krista zâra Pathian pawm tlâk, thlarau lam inthawina hlântu, puithiam thianghlim in lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in, “En teh, lung hlu tak ka thlan, A kil lungphûm chu Zion-ah ka dah ta, Amah ring chu tu mah an mualpho lo vang,” a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni ringtute tân chuan lung hlu tak a ni, ring lote tân erawh chuan, “In satute lung duh loh, a kil lung pawimawh ber.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite inchhuih tlûkna lung, Insut tlûkna lungpui chu,” a ni ve thung. Thu chu an awih loh avângin an tlu a, chutianga awm tûr rênga ruat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangni zawng hnam thlan, Lalpa puithiam, hnam thianghlim, Pathian ta bîk, ama êng mak taka lût tûra thim ata ko chhuaktu che u thiltih ropui puang tûr in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian mi in la ni ngai lo va, Tûnah zawng in nih tâk hi: Khawngaih in la hlawh ngai lo va, Tûnah zawng in hlawh tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Duh takte u, khual zin, mi rama awm in nih avângin, thlarau do ṭhîn tisa châknate lakah chuan inthiarfihlîm tûrin ka ngên a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jentail-te zîngah mawi takin khawsa ula, thil sual tia an puh che u pawhin in thil tih ṭhatte anmahni ngeiin an hmu ang a, Pathianin a tlawh hunah che u amah an chawimawi thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa avângin mihring dâna thuneitute hnênah intulût rawh u; thuneitu sâng ber, lalber thu chu awih ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thil sual titute hrema, thil ṭha titute chawimawi tûra a ruat ramawptute thu pawh awih rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eng mah hre lote thu sawi âtthlâk chu thil ṭha tiha tidang tûrin Pathianin a duh a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zalêna awm tûrin, in zalênna chu sual thup nâna hmang lova, Pathian bawihte anga awm zâwk tûrin a duh che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng zah ula, unaute hmangaih ula, Pathian ṭih ula, lalber chu chawimawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangni chhiahhlawhte u, in pute thu awih ula, a ṭha leh a ngilneite chauh ni lovin, a ṭha lote pawh zah rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Miin Pathian duh zâwng nia a hriat tlat avânga a tuar kher loh tûr hrehawm a tuar chuan Pathian lâwmzâwng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In sual avânga in tuarin, chhel takin tuar mah ula in tân hmingṭhatna eng nge awm? Thil ṭha in tih pawha kut in tuar erawh chuan Pathian lâwmzâwng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hetianga awm tûr hian koh in ni, Krista pawh khân in tân a tuar a, a hniakhnung in zui theih nân entawn tûr a hnutchhiah che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan thil sual eng mah a ti lo va, a kâah bumna thu a chhuak hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hau a nih pawhin a hau lêt lo va, a tuar laiin a vau lêt hek lo, dik taka rorêl ṭhîntu hnênah chuan a inkawltîr zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sual thihsana felna neia kan nun theih nân, amah ngeiin thingah khân a taksain kan sualte a phur a; a hliamte chuan tihdam in ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Berâm angin kawng in bo tawh a, tûnah zawng in thlarau Vêngtu leh Hotu hnênah chuan in lo kîr leh tâk hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni nute u, in pasalte thu awih rawh u; chutichuan, an zîngah Pathian thu awih lo an awm pawhin, thu hrilh kher ngai lovin in chêt dân chuan a hneh mai ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />anmahni ngeiin ṭih tak chunga in chêt dân thianghlim chu an hmu dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pâwn lam incheina - sam chei lêrh te, rangkachak ṭhi awrh te, silhfên ṭha inbeltea inchei mawi tum lovin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thinlung aṭanga mize dik, rilru thuhnuairawlh leh nunnêm, inthuamna chhe thei lo chuan inchei zâwk rawh u, chu chu Pathian mit hmuhin a hlu êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang chuan hmasâng hmeichhe thianghlim, Pathiana beiseina nghatte kha, an pasalte thu awihnain an inchei ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sari chuan Abrahama thu a awih a, “Ka Lalpa,” tia a ko ang khân; thil ṭha in tih chuan Sari fate in ni ang; hlauh tûr rêng in nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni pate u, chutiang bawkin nupa in nihnaah in nupuite dimdawi rawh u, chak lo zâwk an nih avâng leh Pathian khawngaihna thilpêk, nunna chu, chanpuitu che u an nih hriain zah thiam rawh u. Tichuan, in ṭawngṭaina dâltu eng mah a awm dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tâwp berah chuan, in za-in rilru hmun khat pu ula, inlainatin unau angin inhmangaih tawn ula, inkhawngaih tawnin thuhnuairawlh takin awm rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />sual sualin thungrûl suh ula, ânchhia pawh ânchhiaa thungrûl lovin, malsâwm hlauh zâwk rawh u; malsâwmna dawng tûrin asin Pathianin a koh che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in, “Dam thlahlela, hlim ni hmêl hmuh duh chuan Sual lakah a lei vêng ṭha sela, A hmui pawh bumna thu sawi lo tûrin vêng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sual hawisanin thil ṭha ti rawh se, Remna zawngin ûm zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa mit chu mi felte chungah a fu a, An ṭawngṭaiin a beng a lo dawh ṭhîn. Thil ṭha lo titute chungah erawh chuan Lalpa hmêl chu a dur ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil ṭha tih lama ṭhahnem in ngaih chuan tu nge in chungah thil ṭha lo ti ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil dik in tih avânga in tuar chuan vânneihthlâkah ngai rawh u. Tu mah hlau suh ula, mangang hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Krista chu zah ula, in thinlungah lalah neih rawh u. In beisei zâwt apiang che u chhâng tûrin inpeih sa reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, thuhnuairawlh leh hawihhâwm takin, chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang tak neiin ti ang che u; tichuan, Kristaa in awm dân ṭha sawi hnâwmtute chu tihzahin an awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian remtiha tuar in nih rau rau chuan, thil sual tih avânga tuar ai chuan thil ṭha tih avânga tuar chu a ṭha zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Krista pawh kan sualte avângin vawi khat a thi a, Pathian hnêna hruai theihna tûr che uin, mi dik chu mi dik lote tân a thi a ni. Tisaah tihhlum a ni a, thlarauvah erawh chuan tihnunin a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan tân ina awm thlaraute hnênah thu a zuk hril a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûngte chu Nova lawng tuk chhûnga Pathianin dawhthei taka a nghah laia, awih duh lote thlarau kha an ni. Lawngah chuan, mi tlêm tê, pariat lek, tuia chhandam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi anpui baptisma hian, Isua Krista thawhlehna avângin tûnah a chhandam ta che u a ni; baptisma chu taksaa bawlhhlawh silfaina mai a ni lo, chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang taka Pathian hnêna thu tiamna hi a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isua Krista chu vânah kalin Pathian ding lamah a awm a, vântirhkohte thuneihna te, thiltihtheihna te a thuhnuaiah an awm ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kristan taksaa a tuar avângin nangni pawh chutiang rilru chu pu ve rawh u; tisaa tuar tawh chuan sual a bânsan ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tisaa a dam chhûng chu mihring châknate ûm tawh lova Pathian duhzâwnga a awm tawh zâwk theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jentail-te duhzâwng tih nân, tûn hma hun in hman zozai kha a tâwk ta e; hurnaah te, taksa châknaah te, uain hehnaah te, zu hmun hlimnaah te, zu in honaah te, milem biakna tenawm takah te in inhman ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tûnah an nawmsak bâwl anga in bâwl ve tâk loh avâng hian mak an ti a, an sawichhe ta che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi nung leh mitthite ngaihtuah tûra inpeih sa hnênah chuan an chanchin anmahniin an la sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian mitthite hnênah pawh Chanchin Ṭha hril a ni, mi dangte ang bawka an chungthu rêl a niha, Pathian hmaa thlarauva an nun theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil zawng zawng tâwp hun chu a hnai ta a, in ṭawngṭai theih nân rilru fîm tak puin invawng fel rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil dang zawng aiin thinlung taka inhmangaih tawn uar rawh u, hmangaihnain sual tam tak a khuh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phunnawi lovin inmikhual tawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian khawngaihna thilpêk tam tak enkawltu ṭhate angin Thlarau lam thilpêk in dawn apiang chu rawng inbâwlsak tawn nân hmang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu pawhin thu an sawi chuan Pathian thu ngei sawi rawh se, rawngbâwltu pawhin Pathianin chakna a pêk angin bâwl rawh se; chutichuan, Isua Krista avângin Pathian chu engkimah chawimawiin a awm thei ang, ropuina leh thiltihtheihna chatuanin a ta a ni si a. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Duh takte u, fiahna na tak in zînga lo thleng hi thil mak tak lo thleng taah ngai suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Krista tuarna ṭâwmpuitute in nih avângin lâwm zâwk ula, ropui taka a lo lan hun chuan hlim leh lâwmin in la khat dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista hminga hau in nih chuan in nihlawh e, thlarau ropui tak, Pathian thlarau chu, nangmahniah a chêng tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In zîngah tu mahin tual thah avâng emaw, rûkrûk avâng emaw, thil sual tih avâng emaw, mi tibuaitu nih avângin emaw tuar suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kristian in nih avânga tuar in nih chuan in zak tûr a ni lo, Krista hming in put avângin Pathian chawimawi zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rorêlna chu ṭan a hun ta a, Pathian chhûngte aṭangin ṭan a ni ang. Keimahniah ṭan a nih si chuan, Pathian Chanchin Ṭha thu awih lote chu engtin tak awm ang maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in, “Mi dikte mah chhandam hrâm an nih chuan, sakhaw ngaihsak lo mi sualte chu, engtin tak awm ang maw,” a tih ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathian remtih anga tuarte chuan thil ṭha ti zêlin an thlarau chu Siamtu rinawm tak hnênah kawltîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In zînga kohhran upate chu, kei upa ve bawk, Krista tuarnate hmutu leh ropuina lo lang tûr chan ve beiseitu hian ka fuih e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In zînga Pathian berâmte chu enkawl ṭha rawh u, tihluih ngai lovin Pathian duh anga châk taka tiin, hlêp beisei vâng ni lovin, rawngbâwl duhna rilru puin enkawl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In hote chungah intilal suh ula, pâwlhote entawn tlâk ni zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Berâm vêngtu Lalber a lo lan hunah chawimawina lukhum ropui chul thei lo chu in dawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin nangni ṭhalaite u, upate thu awih rawh u. In za-in thuhnuairawlhnaa inthuamin rawng inbâwlsak rawh u. “Pathianin chapote a dodâl a, inngaitlâwmte erawh chu a khawngaih ṭhîn,” tih a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, a hun takah chawimawia in awm theih nân Pathian kut chak tak hnuaiah inphahhniam ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />in manganna zawng zawng ama chungah nghat vek rawh u; a ngaihtuah êm êm che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngaihven ula, fîmkhur rawh u; in hmêlma Diabola chu, sakeibaknei rûm ṭhîn angin ei tûr zawngin a phî ruai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rinnaah hian ding nghet tlat ula, amah chu do rawh u. Khawvêl hmun danga in unaute pawhin chutiang bawk chu an tuar tih in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rei lo tê in tuar hnuin, Kristaa a chatuan ropuina chang tûra kotu che u, khawngaihnaa khat Pathian chuan a rawn tungding ang che u a, siam ṭhaa tichakin a tinghet ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama hnênah chuan thiltihtheihna kumkhuain awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaupa, mi rinawm a ni tih ka hriat Silvana kutah hian he lehkha tawi tê hi ka rawn thawn che u a ni. Hei hi Pathian khawngaihna chu a ni tih hriattîr tûr che u leh chutah chuan ding nghet tlat tûra ka fuihna che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babulon kohhran, nangmahni ang bawka thlan hian chibai an bûk a che u; ka fapa Marka pawhin a bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista hmangaihnaa kut invuanin chibai inbûk rawh u. Nangni Kristaa awm zawng zawngte hnênah remna awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
